,null,null,"0ahUKEwjaz5_jvdKWAxWEcvUHHYC3KI8Q3YcHCKEBKAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjaz5_jvdKWAxWEcvUHHYC3KI8Q3IcHCKABKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["撰寫時間2024.7.24\n\n剛好碰到第二碗99的活動，超級幸運！\n\n點了鹹蛋黃跟川味牛的口味\n湯本身很不錯，麵又可以選我喜歡的超硬\n豬肉有烤過的煙燻味，處理的很好\n麻辣這碗是牛肉的，牛五花很像我去烤肉店烤出來的牛五花，好吃又刷嘴的那種五花肉\n唯一的缺點是吃起來蠻像牛肉麵的，稍無特色，因此我比較喜鹹蛋黃口味。\n以台北牛肉麵來說190也差不多價格，並不會不划算，只是要有心理準備吃起來就是牛肉麵的味道。\n炸雞炸的也很嫩，旁邊有附辣椒粉和美乃滋，很貼心的配置。\n泡菜是有點像黃金泡菜的樣式，但沒這麼濃，這麼甜膩，是屬於比較清爽的口感，我覺得蠻好吃的，只是份量不多小小碟。\n\n我覺得店家在行銷上蠻用心的，7/30前第二碗99。\n還有集點卡可以集，金額超過300還有擲骰子換兌換卷的遊戲。\n我覺得這些都是店家用心經營的一部分。\n環境乾淨，也有電子支付，有機會會再訪。\n\n雖然不是正統的日式拉麵，但口味好，環境整潔，價格划算，這些對我而言更重要。",null,[0,33]]]],[null,1735630616000000,1735630616000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04bEJRa1JNVFJuYzU4WUFBUlFLZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfQm04bEJRa1JNVFJuYzU4WUFBUlFLZxoSQ2dzSW1MN091d1lRdE02OWZ3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjaz5_jvdKWAxWEcvUHHYC3KI8Q_2MIogEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2874671841874029397/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlaM05oZFZOQkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝哥的喜歡～\n也期待你的再度光臨喔\n感謝您～",null,[0,23]]]],[null,null,13303,["https://www.goog